{"ticker":"NSC","updated":"2026-10-23T23:23:22Z","profile":{"longName":"Norfolk Southern Corporation","shortName":"Norfolk Southern Corporation","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Railroads","country":"United States","website":"https://www.norfolksouthern.com","fullTimeEmployees":19300,"marketCap":74121256960,"trailingPE":27.660519,"forwardPE":22.835287,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":5.717909,"pegRatio":3.98,"targetMeanPrice":360.27777,"targetHighPrice":400.0,"targetLowPrice":297.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":18,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":0.136,"earningsGrowth":0.067,"grossMargins":0.44527,"operatingMargins":0.33806,"profitMargins":0.20705,"totalRevenue":12963000320,"beta":null,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":358.6,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":277.8,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.6},"summary":"Norfolk Southern Corporation, together with its subsidiaries, engages in the rail transportation of raw materials, intermediate products, and finished goods in the United States. The company transports agriculture, forest, and consumer products comprising soybeans, wheat, corn, fertilizers, livestock and poultry feed, food products, food oils, flour, sweeteners, ethanol, lumber and wood products, pulp board and paper products, wood fibers, wood pulp, beverages, and canned goods; chemicals, including sulfur and related chemicals, petroleum products comprising crude oil, chlorine and bleaching compounds, plastics, rubber, industrial chemicals, chemical wastes, sand, and natural gas liquids; metals and construction materials, such as steel, aluminum products, machinery, scrap metals, cement, aggregates, minerals, clay, transportation equipment, and military-related products; and automotive, including finished motor vehicles and automotive parts, as well as coal. It also transports overseas freight through various Atlantic and Gulf Coast ports; and operates an intermodal network. Norfolk Southern Corporation was incorporated in 1980 and is headquartered in Atlanta, Georgia.","summary_zh":"諾福克南方公司及其子公司在美國從事原料、中間產品和製成品的鐵路運輸。該公司運送農業、林業和消費品，包括大豆、小麥、玉米、化肥、畜禽飼料、食品、食用油、麵粉、甜味劑、乙醇、木材和木製品、紙漿板和紙製品、木纖維、木漿、飲料和罐頭食品；化學品，包括硫磺及相關化學品、石油產品（包括原油、氯和漂白化合物）、塑膠、橡膠、工業化學品、化學廢棄物、沙子和天然氣液體；金屬和建築材料，例如鋼鐵、鋁製品、機械、廢金屬、水泥、骨料、礦物、黏土、運輸設備和軍事相關產品；和汽車，包括成品汽車和汽車零件，以及煤炭。它還透過大西洋和墨西哥灣沿岸的各個港口運輸海外貨物；並運作多式聯運網路。諾福克南方公司成立於 1980 年，總部位於喬治亞州亞特蘭大。","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"鐵路","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":284.48,"h":284.48,"l":275.4,"c":277.39,"v":2649500},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":274.99,"h":276.9,"l":273.71,"c":276.67,"v":2275300},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":276.36,"h":276.94,"l":272.08,"c":272.35,"v":2525300},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":278.8,"h":280.76,"l":276.28,"c":277.8,"v":3031700},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":277.5,"h":280.12,"l":277.5,"c":279.98,"v":1543100},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":277.97,"h":278.67,"l":275.15,"c":278.25,"v":1718700},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":278.22,"h":279.61,"l":276.52,"c":278.19,"v":2085400},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":278.56,"h":280.28,"l":277.25,"c":279.76,"v":923300},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":279.82,"h":280.24,"l":276.6,"c":277.75,"v":1302000},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":277.0,"h":277.78,"l":274.83,"c":275.59,"v":1946200},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":275.49,"h":276.63,"l":273.33,"c":273.45,"v":1362800},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":272.42,"h":274.01,"l":268.23,"c":272.36,"v":1979400},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":271.9,"h":275.62,"l":271.88,"c":274.0,"v":1447200},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":273.86,"h":276.23,"l":273.76,"c":274.72,"v":2243800},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":277.0,"h":277.46,"l":274.78,"c":277.16,"v":1169500},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":278.0,"h":280.99,"l":277.61,"c":278.09,"v":1707100},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":278.95,"h":280.11,"l":276.55,"c":278.0,"v":2854900},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":278.38,"h":283.12,"l":277.76,"c":282.68,"v":1095400},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":283.8,"h":284.76,"l":282.61,"c":283.71,"v":2712300},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":284.69,"h":294.78,"l":282.96,"c":290.55,"v":2918200},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":291.0,"h":293.64,"l":289.81,"c":292.08,"v":1734400},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":292.45,"h":296.38